er the business idea is good.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"What is the bare minimum you need to start safely — cash, tools, supplies, labour, and time?"},{"id":"82a1fb32-3508-4549-9ccd-d06c2f471684","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","stage_code":"acquisition","updated_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","question_id":"bd7bd81e-1d9b-49e7-b6e2-271ce6bffc89","variant_role":"candidate_conversation","follow_up_text":"This tests whether you understand costs, tax, debt, wages, and delayed obligations.","guardrail_text":"Do not ask whether the acquisition is good.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"When the business receives money, do you know what must be kept aside before anything can be treated as yours?"},{"id":"fb6bda06-90b4-41da-9059-414097cc533d","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","stage_code":"existing","updated_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","question_id":"bd7bd81e-1d9b-49e7-b6e2-271ce6bffc89","variant_role":"candidate_conversation","follow_up_text":"This tests whether you understand costs, tax, debt, wages, and delayed obligations.","guardrail_text":"Do not assess business viability.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"When money comes into the business, do you know what is already spoken for before anything can be treated as profit?"},{"id":"effec526-16a1-428f-a9f5-ad0578adec29","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","stage_code":"franchise","updated_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","question_id":"bd7bd81e-1d9b-49e7-b6e2-271ce6bffc89","variant_role":"candidate_conversation","follow_up_text":"This tests whether you understand costs, tax, fees, wages, and delayed obligations.","guardrail_text":"Do not ask whether the franchise is good.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"After sales come in, do you know what must be kept aside for costs, fees, tax, wages, and future payments before anything is yours?"},{"id":"c5e2d6f6-5bfc-4f0b-b7ac-a2d9da835347","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","stage_code":"startup","updated_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","question_id":"bd7bd81e-1d9b-49e7-b6e2-271ce6bffc89","variant_role":"candidate_conversation","follow_up_text":"Money received today is not automatically money you can spend today.","guardrail_text":"Do not ask whether the idea is good.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"When money comes in, do you know what part is actually yours to spend?"},{"id":"85363c88-825a-474f-bf6c-ba0222e6ec24","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","stage_code":"acquisition","updated_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","question_id":"c47e1175-ed27-46a2-84ad-f8617ba4bd9d","variant_role":"candidate_conversation","follow_up_text":"The point is not toughness. The point is whether the work survives discomfort.","guardrail_text":"Do not assess acquisition attractiveness.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"When the purchase process becomes uncertain or disappointing, are you likely to stay disciplined or rush or change direction?"},{"id":"d0e4b4f5-ff44-44ed-a0e3-e16e8bc9c1ac","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","stage_code":"existing","updated_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769+00:00","question_id":"c47e1175-ed27-46a2-84ad-f8617ba4bd9d","variant_role":"candidate_conversation","follow_up_text":"The point is not toughness. The point is whether the work survives discomfort.","guardrail_text":"Do not assess business viability.","experience_code":null,"conversational_prompt":"When the business becomes uncertain or disappointing, are you likely to stay disciplined or keep changing direction?"},{"id":"58da3805-8f1f-40fb-87bd-ce178d4fa20c","version":"stage0_v1","is_active":true,"created_at":"2026-07-08T02:43:14.499769